Retain the silver rosette on anatomical LEFT, viewer RIGHT, visible on the near temple in this shallow left yaw. Let hair locks, ears and horns follow this shallow physical head turn while keeping the same head size.

LEFT-TO-RIGHT ORDER REMAINS:
1 180 DOWN frontal tucked chin;
2 202.5 DOWN-LEFT mostly down/slightleft;
3 225 DOWN-LEFT balanced;
4 247.5 DOWN-LEFT mostlyleft/somedown;
5 270 LEFT clear leftward head yaw/levelpitch;
