The first seven are already correct and must remain the same. Keep all eight bodies frontal and planted exactly as Image1. Preserve eight distinct complete silhouettes with green separation and safe outer edges. No extra figures, copied guide marks, labels, numbers, arrows, text, props, shadows, detached effects, green inside the pet, or whole-sprite rotation. Output only the full eight-figure repaired strip.
